    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astra Industria</strong> is a factory builder with incremental mechanics, designed for players who love the genre but don\u2019t have 4\u20136 hours a day to play. Instead of requiring deep micromanagement and long play sessions, Astra Industria offers a faster-paced experience that still delivers the satisfying feeling of building, optimizing, and expanding a complex production system. Whether you have 20 minutes or a full evening, you\u2019ll be able to make meaningful progress and enjoy the thrill of watching your automated empire grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/9618c3ba3d41d48045acf56f952705d2.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target individual asteroids, scan for hidden deposits, and extract raw materials with precise clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rock formation is unique. Some teem with rare metals, others hide crystalline minerals. So choose wisely to build the foundation of your galactic empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/37f03b08a48bfbc77a563b79784468d1.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/74efc2b4d313bd8b41b69dd4dbdbee43.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/74efc2b4d313bd8b41b69dd4dbdbee43.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/74efc2b4d313bd8b41b69dd4dbdbee43.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a deep tech tree to unlock power stations, drone squadrons, and self-drilling turret arrays, each breakthrough multiplying your output and strategic options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy fleets of drilling and data-gathering satellites that autonomously harvest asteroids at light-speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a6b5ddc9805acea9f8c30f37520438c4.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/66d959f5ad5f5c77ef08f6af28694d3f.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/66d959f5ad5f5c77ef08f6af28694d3f.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/66d959f5ad5f5c77ef08f6af28694d3f.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct modular orbital hub stations where production lines, transport conduits, and docking ships operate in seamless harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize power distribution, logistics routes, and defense systems (shields, lasers, and missile batteries) to ensure your station thrives even in the harshest environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/bb3c18e77e8d8eb496a7574dbc676e92.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/2e895f873172a10013c4eb0d9d834081.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/2e895f873172a10013c4eb0d9d834081.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/2e895f873172a10013c4eb0d9d834081.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine raw ores into high-grade components, assemble everything from mining lasers to defense satellites, and pack finished goods for intergalactic trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate assembly lines, synchronize production schedules, and exploit every market. Each crafted item pushing your industrial might ever further.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astra Industria</strong> is a factory builder with incremental mechanics, designed for players who love the genre but don\u2019t have 4\u20136 hours a day to play. Instead of requiring deep micromanagement and long play sessions, Astra Industria offers a faster-paced experience that still delivers the satisfying feeling of building, optimizing, and expanding a complex production system. Whether you have 20 minutes or a full evening, you\u2019ll be able to make meaningful progress and enjoy the thrill of watching your automated empire grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/9618c3ba3d41d48045acf56f952705d2.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target individual asteroids, scan for hidden deposits, and extract raw materials with precise clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rock formation is unique. Some teem with rare metals, others hide crystalline minerals. So choose wisely to build the foundation of your galactic empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/37f03b08a48bfbc77a563b79784468d1.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/74efc2b4d313bd8b41b69dd4dbdbee43.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/74efc2b4d313bd8b41b69dd4dbdbee43.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/74efc2b4d313bd8b41b69dd4dbdbee43.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a deep tech tree to unlock power stations, drone squadrons, and self-drilling turret arrays, each breakthrough multiplying your output and strategic options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy fleets of drilling and data-gathering satellites that autonomously harvest asteroids at light-speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a6b5ddc9805acea9f8c30f37520438c4.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/66d959f5ad5f5c77ef08f6af28694d3f.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/66d959f5ad5f5c77ef08f6af28694d3f.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/66d959f5ad5f5c77ef08f6af28694d3f.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct modular orbital hub stations where production lines, transport conduits, and docking ships operate in seamless harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize power distribution, logistics routes, and defense systems (shields, lasers, and missile batteries) to ensure your station thrives even in the harshest environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/bb3c18e77e8d8eb496a7574dbc676e92.avif?t=1752572329\" data-has-big width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/2e895f873172a10013c4eb0d9d834081.poster.avif?t=1752572329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/2e895f873172a10013c4eb0d9d834081.webm?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/2e895f873172a10013c4eb0d9d834081.mp4?t=1752572329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine raw ores into high-grade components, assemble everything from mining lasers to defense satellites, and pack finished goods for intergalactic trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate assembly lines, synchronize production schedules, and exploit every market. Each crafted item pushing your industrial might ever further.</p></li></ul>",
